wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":541,"digest":"sha256:660adae0556a2e49640b4c8f2f23d5463ca6f37f9763d8dce0b7009561f5238a","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T10:04:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T10:04:18Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy/releases/download/v0.5.2/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy/tarball/v0.5.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy/zipball/v0.5.2","body":"# Gaoxy v0.5.2\n\nThis patch releases the existing Gaoxy runtime from its new repository,\n[gsmlg-dev/gaoxy](https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy), and retries public Hex\ndistribution after the previous organization's hosted release could not start.\nRuntime code and locked dependencies are unchanged from v0.5.1.\n\nThe five MIT distributions are `gaoxy`, `gaoxy_http`, `gaoxy_http3`,\n`gaoxy_proxy` and `gaoxy_websock_adapter`, all version 0.5.2. The adapter retains\nthe OTP application name `websock_adapter` and upstream WebSockAdapter 0.6.0\nsource attribution and license. Phoenix dependencies:\n\n```elixir\n{:gaoxy_http, \"~> 0.5.2\"},\n{:websock_adapter, \"~> 0.5.2\", hex: :gaoxy_websock_adapter, override: true}\n```\n\nConfigure the endpoint with `adapter: Gaoxy.PhoenixAdapter` and the existing\nHTTP/HTTPS and explicit WebSocket-path settings. The override preserves Gaoxy's\nWebSocket dispatch and native H2/H3 handshake validation. See the\n[HTTP guide](https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy/blob/v0.5.2/docs/native-http.md).\n\nThe release workflow builds all five packages before publication, publishes\nthem in dependency order, and compares public tarball bytes before tagging.\nGitHub assets include those source packages, the Linux x86_64 application\narchive and `SHA256SUMS` when that complete workflow succeeds. The\n[release acceptance](https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/gaoxy/blob/main/docs/acceptance/release-0.5.2.md)\nrecords actual hosted, Hex, consumer and download results separately.\n\nThere are no new protocol capabilities. Existing activation differences and\nprotocol limits remain unchanged. This patch adds no Debian portability or\nproduction-deployment claim. Specialist abnormal/disconnect, slow-peer,\npressure, load and soak qualification and release-artifact E2E remain outside\nthis release.\n"}